{
  "name": "Schedule clients' social posts from Google Sheets with Rizamo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule clients' social posts from a Google Sheet\n\n### How it works\nFor agencies that plan clients' posts in a spreadsheet. Every 15 minutes the workflow reads the sheet and takes the rows whose Status is **Ready**. Each one becomes a scheduled post on that client's Rizamo profile, at the row's date and time, with its images or video.\n\nThe row is then marked **Scheduled** with the post's ID. If Rizamo refuses a row (a missing account, a video too long for a network), the row's Status shows the error instead, so it is not tried again until someone fixes it and sets it back to Ready.\n\n### The sheet\nColumns: **Profile ID** (prof_...), **Account IDs** (acc_..., separated by commas), **Text**, **Media URLs** (public links, separated by commas, may be empty), **Publish at** (e.g. 2026-12-01 09:00, in the profile's time zone), **Status**, **Post ID**. The Rizamo node's Get Many on Profile and Account lists the IDs.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the verified community node `@rizamohq/n8n-nodes-rizamo` (tested with 0.1.1): open the nodes panel, search **Rizamo** and choose **Install** ([installation guide](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/community-nodes/installation/verified-install/)).\n2. In Rizamo, open **Developers**, create an API key and add it in n8n as a **Rizamo API** credential.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and pick your sheet in **Read rows**, **Mark scheduled** and **Mark failed**.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Customization\nChange the interval in **Every 15 minutes**, or set **When** to Save as Draft for posts a client approves in Rizamo first.",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "ff29ed45-bd06-5c06-a01b-a9de6c746960",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Read the rows marked Ready\nEvery 15 minutes, only rows whose Status is Ready.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "715d5e92-8a61-5c4b-a819-9fb481decb39",
      "name": "Section: read",
